{"id":"msg_m_ex_cafesweety_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_cafesweety","label":"Cafe Sweety · Group"},"label":"2. Bad news! Real bad news!","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_cafesweety_01","next":"msg_m_mainafter_13_03","speakers":{"milk":"Milk","sugar":"Sugar","frima":"Frima"},"icons":{"milk":"si_c141_00_s","sugar":"si_c140_00_s","frima":"si_c142_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_1","text":"Bad news! Real bad news!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_2","text":"What a disaster!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_3","text":"What's wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_4","text":"The cafe made half as much as it did last month.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_5","text":"If things keep going like this, we'll be out on the street!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_6","text":"I made the same amount of money I always have...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_7","text":"I made even more than usual.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_8","text":"Wait, what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_9","text":"So Sugar's earnings didn't change,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_10","text":"and Frima's actually increased?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_11","text":"So that means I'm the only one who made less than before?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_12","text":"Why????","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_13","text":"Come to think of it, our customers haven't been ordering as many milk coffees as they used to.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_14","text":"Why do you think that is?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_15","text":"Um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_16","text":"If I knew the answer to that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_17","text":"would I be asking you guys??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_18","text":"What do you think, Partner?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_19","text":"The milk coffees haven't tasted the same lately.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_20","text":"What?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_21","text":"What are you talking about?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_22","text":"What does it taste like now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_23","text":"Can you be more specific?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_24","text":"Less aromatic, I'd say.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_25","text":"But the aroma is what makes the latte so special.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_26","text":"How can it be less aromatic?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_27","text":"I use the vending machine to make every single milk coffee.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_28","text":"I've got the recipe down to a science.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_29","text":"How can it have changed?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_30","text":"Could there be any other reason why","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_31","text":"milk coffee sales have gone down?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_32","text":"Maybe the recipe hasn't changed, but customers just want something different.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_33","text":"Could that be it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_34","text":"Could it be the ingredients?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_35","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_36","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_37","text":"Like what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_38","text":"Any idea?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_39","text":"Tell me!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_40","text":"The","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_41","text":"supplier","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_42","text":"changed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_43","text":"?????","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_44","text":"When?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_45","text":"Didn't we discuss this last time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_46","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_47","text":"Am I the only one in the dark here?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_48","text":"When did our supplier change?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_49","text":"Last month.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_50","text":"They were cheaper than our old supplier.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_51","text":"I thought Frima told you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_52","text":"Well, since this is my first time hearing about it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_53","text":"I'd say that's highly unlikely!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_54","text":"As I remember it, Frima asked us for our opinions","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_55","text":"and we all agreed to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_56","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_57","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_58","text":"You two are clearly messing with me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_59","text":"No one ever asked my opinion about any of this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_60","text":"And now you're trying to throw me under the bus!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_61","text":"You think you're better than me just because your earnings haven't gone down?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_62","text":"Wait.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_63","text":"Copy & Paste.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_64","text":"11:09 Frima: Agreed?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_65","text":"11:09 Sugar: I have no opinion.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_66","text":"11:09 Sugar: I did look up the new supplier though, and apparently their products are sweeter.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_67","text":"11:09 Sugar: Milk, what do you think?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_68","text":"11:10 Milk: Whatever, stop bothering me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_69","text":"11:10 Milk: Do whatever you want.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_70","text":"11:10 Frima: OK.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_71","text":"Um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_72","text":"I don't remember any of that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_73","text":"No wonder this new supplier came so cheap... Their products taste awful!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_74","text":"A sample was sent to us before we made our final decision.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"frima","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_75","text":"Mmhmm.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_76","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_77","text":"Fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_78","text":"You got me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_cafesweety_02_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"milk","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_cafesweety_02_79","text":"What else can I say?","jump":null}],"chat":true}